Forge archetype: Athlete. Balance resistance, bodyweight work, cardio, mobility, balance, core, and safe power. No quality should dominate without goals or behavioral evidence.
In the catalog this means a deliberate mix across categories: compound strength (squat, hinge, push, pull), at least one plyometric or cardio movement, at least one core movement, and at least one mobility or stretching movement, spread across upper body, lower body, and trunk.
